01:17:45.350 --> 01:17:53.210
He can't wait to drive all the way to New York to crash the tail end of this corporate party and get the leftover sushi that no one else wanted to eat.
他迫不及待地想开车一路去纽约，去搅乱那个公司派对的尾声，然后吃掉没人想吃的剩寿司。

1522
01:17:53.210 --> 01:17:55.470
But that's been sitting out for a while.
但那寿司已经放了很久了。

1523
01:17:55.670 --> 01:17:56.730
For a long while.
放了很久了。

1524
01:17:57.150 --> 01:17:58.410
I just want to say.
我只想说。

1525
01:17:59.470 --> 01:18:00.810
